1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,241
A black hole would turn

2
00:00:01,241 --> 00:00:02,242
you into spaghetti.

3
00:00:02,262 --> 00:00:02,991
Really.

4
00:00:03,011 --> 00:00:04,391
That's not a joke,

5
00:00:04,411 --> 00:00:05,152
it's physics.

6
00:00:05,172 --> 00:00:06,413
Gravity pulls much harder on

7
00:00:06,413 --> 00:00:07,132
your feet,

8
00:00:07,152 --> 00:00:08,122
which are closer,

9
00:00:08,142 --> 00:00:08,895
than on your head.

10
00:00:08,915 --> 00:00:09,993
That difference stretches you

11
00:00:09,993 --> 00:00:10,747
long and thin.

12
00:00:10,767 --> 00:00:12,117
Near a small black hole,

13
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:13,481
about ten times the Sun's

14
00:00:13,481 --> 00:00:15,148
mass, it happens before you

15
00:00:15,148 --> 00:00:16,280
even reach the edge.

16
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,604
Scientists have a real name

17
00:00:17,604 --> 00:00:17,951
for it:
